WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.924 --> 00:00:18.775
Drip drip Chirp!

2
00:00:19.416 --> 00:00:23.658
Chirp! With her super hearing, Roxy heard lots of usual school sounds.

3
00:00:24.739 --> 00:00:26.681
She heard water dripping from the art room sink.

4
00:00:29.022 --> 00:00:31.324
She heard a cricket chirping in one of the kindergarten rooms.

5
00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:34.621
But she also heard something unexpected.

6
00:00:35.541 --> 00:00:37.801
It was a deep voice coming from under the school.

7
00:00:37.821 --> 00:00:40.662
"Work! Work!

8
00:00:40.722 --> 00:00:42.503
Work!" growled the voice.

9
00:00:42.523 --> 00:00:44.743
"Move faster!"

10
00:00:44.763 --> 00:00:47.024
"That's Mr.

11
00:00:47.104 --> 00:00:48.725
Sweeps!" gasped Roxy.

12
00:00:49.565 --> 00:00:50.985
"I knew I shouldn't trust him!"

13
00:00:52.946 --> 00:00:54.906
Roxy ran down the stairs to the basement.

14
00:00:55.967 --> 00:00:57.667
She came to a pair of locked doors.

15
00:00:59.227 --> 00:01:00.688
Roxy stared hard at the doors.

16
00:01:01.648 --> 00:01:03.089
Lasers shot out from her eyes.

17
00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:09.534
Whiz-hoo! The doors blew apart, and Roxy ran through the opening.

18
00:01:10.475 --> 00:01:11.516
The basement was empty.

19
00:01:12.777 --> 00:01:15.038
Roxy glanced around and spotted a trapdoor.

20
00:01:18.281 --> 00:01:19.682
She rushed over and opened it.

21
00:01:20.983 --> 00:01:23.465
Roxy jumped down, landing in a large cavern.

22
00:01:25.066 --> 00:01:27.688
There, Roxy saw all the students hard at work.

23
00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:31.370
Some were chipping away at the rock walls with pickaxes.

24
00:01:32.411 --> 00:01:33.812
Others were pushing wheelbarrows.

25
00:01:33.832 --> 00:01:36.594
"Is this a mine?"

26
00:01:36.895 --> 00:01:37.615
Roxy wondered.

27
00:01:38.696 --> 00:01:39.897
She looked around some more.

28
00:01:41.919 --> 00:01:44.541
She saw one student pull something sparkly from the wall.

29
00:01:44.561 --> 00:01:48.884
"Whoa!" gasped Roxy.

30
00:01:52.607 --> 00:01:53.748
is a diamond mine!"

31
00:01:54.969 --> 00:01:57.431
The students were all wearing the star buttons from Mr.

32
00:01:57.491 --> 00:02:00.277
Sweeps. Nobody looked at Rocket Girl.

33
00:02:01.118 --> 00:02:02.439
They were all too busy working.

34
00:02:02.459 --> 00:02:06.761
"This is totally weird," Roxy said to herself.

35
00:02:08.262 --> 00:02:09.363
She saw Terrell.

36
00:02:10.544 --> 00:02:11.665
"What's going on here?"

37
00:02:11.985 --> 00:02:12.866
Roxy called to him.

38
00:02:15.327 --> 00:02:16.328
Terrell didn't answer.

39
00:02:17.749 --> 00:02:18.830
He didn't even look at her.

40
00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:21.551
"He's hypnotized!"

41
00:02:21.852 --> 00:02:22.752
Roxy realized.

42
00:02:22.772 --> 00:02:25.574
"Everybody is.

43
00:02:26.175 --> 00:02:27.936
It's because of those star buttons."

44
00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:32.822
Suddenly Jack and Mara sneaked up from behind and grabbed Roxy.

45
00:02:35.363 --> 00:02:36.723
She thought about fighting them off.

46
00:02:37.564 --> 00:02:39.304
But Roxy knew that wasn't a good idea.

47
00:02:40.205 --> 00:02:41.565
She didn't want to hurt her friends.

48
00:02:43.586 --> 00:02:44.607
Mr. Sweeps appeared.

49
00:02:44.627 --> 00:02:48.868
"Thought you could stop me, did you?"

50
00:02:49.128 --> 00:02:49.549
he said.

51
00:02:50.549 --> 00:02:53.350
Roxy noticed he was wearing a glowing, star-shaped ring.

52
00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:55.931
"What's going on down here?"

53
00:02:56.312 --> 00:02:57.032
Roxy demanded.

54
00:02:58.584 --> 00:03:01.726
"There are lots of diamonds here under your school," said Mr.

55
00:03:01.786 --> 00:03:04.348
Sweeps. "And I want them!

56
00:03:05.369 --> 00:03:08.150
I hypnotized your teachers and made them leave town.

57
00:03:09.291 --> 00:03:12.834
Then I hypnotized your schoolmates so they could mine the diamonds."

58
00:03:14.275 --> 00:03:15.715
Mr. Sweeps let out a cackle.

59
00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:20.719
"I am going to be rich!"

60
00:03:21.699 --> 00:03:23.180
"You'll never get away with this!"

61
00:03:23.621 --> 00:03:24.261
said Roxy.

62
00:03:25.342 --> 00:03:26.523
Mr. Sweeps grinned.

63
00:03:26.543 --> 00:03:28.104
"Oh yes.

64
00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:29.301
I will!"

65
00:03:31.885 --> 00:03:33.187
He looked at Jack and Mara.

66
00:03:33.208 --> 00:03:35.691
"Bring the prisoner this way!"
